  "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Agentic Coding Research Report - 2026-05-24</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 10pt;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #000000;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 10px;\n        }\n\n        /* Header Styles */\n        header {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            padding: 5px 10px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        header h1 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 14pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        header .date {\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-top: 2px;\n        }\n\n        /* Navigation */\n        nav {\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 10px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        nav a {\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-right: 15px;\n            font-size: 9pt;\n        }\n\n        nav a:hover {\n            color: #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        /* Main Layout */\n        main {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 40% 35% 25%;\n            gap: 10px;\n            padding: 10px 0;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 1200px) {\n            main {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .technical-insights {\n                grid-column: 1 / -1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            main {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .technical-insights {\n                grid-column: 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Section Styles */\n        section {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            padding: 10px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n\n        section h2 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 12pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            padding-bottom: 5px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        /* Product Card Styles */\n        .product-card {\n            padding: 8px 0;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;\n        }\n\n        .product-card:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n        }\n\n        .product-title {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 3px;\n        }\n\n        .product-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .product-title a:visited {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .product-description {\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #828282;\n            margin-bottom: 3px;\n        }\n\n        .product-meta {\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #000000;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        /* Update Card Styles */\n        .update-card {\n            padding: 8px 0;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;\n        }\n\n        .update-card:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n        }\n\n        .update-title {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 3px;\n        }\n\n        .update-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .update-description {\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #828282;\n            margin-bottom: 3px;\n        }\n\n        .update-meta {\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .update-type {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.release { background-color: #ffe4e4; color: #8b0000; }\n        .update-type.feature { background-color: #e4f4ff; color: #00008b; }\n        .update-type.bugfix { background-color: #fff4e4; color: #8b4500; }\n        .update-type.announcement { background-color: #f0e4ff; color: #4b0082; }\n\n        /* Insight Card Styles */\n        .insight-card {\n            padding: 8px 0;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;\n        }\n\n        .insight-card:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n        }\n\n        .insight-title {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 3px;\n        }\n\n        .insight-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .insight-description {\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #828282;\n            margin-bottom: 3px;\n        }\n\n        .insight-meta {\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.technical { background-color: #e4ffe4; color: #006400; }\n        .insight-type.opinion { background-color: #ffe4f4; color: #8b008b; }\n        .insight-type.discussion { background-color: #f0f0f0; color: #4a4a4a; }\n\n        /* Footer Styles */\n        footer {\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 20px 10px;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        footer a {\n            color: #000000;\n            margin: 0 10px;\n        }\n\n        /* Utility Classes */\n        .metric {\n            display: inline-block;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            color: #ff6600;\n            margin-left: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .highlight {\n            color: #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        /* Print Styles */\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n\n            section {\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n\n            a {\n                color: #000000;\n                text-decoration: underline;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Code Styles */\n        code {\n            font-family: Monaco, Consolas, monospace;\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 2px 4px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        /* Scrollbar Styles */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            width: 8px;\n        }\n\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n            background: #f6f6ef;\n        }\n\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n            background: #ff6600;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n        }\n\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n            background: #ff5500;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Agentic Coding Research Report</h1>\n            <div class=\"date\">2026-05-24</div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <nav>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <a href=\"#new-products\">New Products (7)</a>\n            <a href=\"#whitelist-updates\">Product Updates (21)</a>\n            <a href=\"#technical-insights\">Technical Insights (21)</a>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <main class=\"container\">\n        <!-- New Products Section -->\n        <section class=\"new-products\" id=\"new-products\">\n            <h2>New Products</h2>\n\n            <div class=\"product-card\">\n                <div class=\"product-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/stitch\" target=\"_blank\">Stitch 3.0</a>\n                    <span class=\"metric\">#1 Product of the Day</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"product-description\">\n                    Google's AI-powered tool for generating and iterating UI screens with AI on a live canvas, designed for developer workflows.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"product-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">AI workflow agent</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Product Hunt</span>\n                    <span>Released: 2026-05-24</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"product-card\">\n                <div class=\"product-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/modelhub\" target=\"_blank\">ModelHub</a>\n                    <span class=\"metric\">#2 Product (181 upvotes)</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"product-description\">\n                    Menu bar app for Mac providing management and access to local LLMs, enabling developers to run and manage AI models locally.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"product-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">AI workflow agent</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Open Source</span>\n                    <span>Released: 2026-05-24</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"product-card\">\n                <div class=\"product-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/google-antigravity\" target=\"_blank\">Google Antigravity CLI</a>\n                    <span class=\"metric\">#1 Product (211 upvotes)</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"product-description\">\n                    Terminal-based coding agent runner with multi-step reasoning, multi-file editing, tool calling, persistent history. Optimized for SSH and keyboard workflows.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"product-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Google</span>\n                    <span>Released: 2026-05-23</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"product-card\">\n                <div class=\"product-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/memdex\" target=\"_blank\">Memdex</a>\n                    <span class=\"metric\">#1 Product (243 upvotes)</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"product-description\">\n                    Turns every AI conversation into reusable local memory for persistent context across coding sessions, addressing key pain point in AI-assisted development.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"product-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Workspace memory</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Context retention</span>\n                    <span>Released: 2026-05-23</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"product-card\">\n                <div class=\"product-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/openhuman\" target=\"_blank\">OpenHuman</a>\n                    <span class=\"metric\">#1 Product of the Week (644 upvotes)</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"product-description\">\n                    Open source AI harness built with human in mind, providing developers with control and transparency over AI coding workflows.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"product-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Open source</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">AI coding agent</span>\n                    <span>Released: 2026-05-17</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"product-card\">\n                <div class=\"product-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/agentmemory\" target=\"_blank\">Agentmemory</a>\n                    <span class=\"metric\">#2 Product</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"product-description\">\n                    Persistent memory solution for Claude Code, Codex, and other coding agents providing context retention across sessions for more effective AI-assisted development.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"product-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Workspace memory</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Claude Code</span>\n                    <span>Released: 2026-05-16</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"product-card\">\n                <div class=\"product-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/claude-code\" target=\"_blank\">Agent View in Claude Code</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"product-description\">\n                    New feature launched by Anthropic enabling developers to manage coding tasks through an agent view interface, significant update to their AI coding platform.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"product-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Code agent</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n                    <span>Released: 2026-05-11</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n        <section class=\"whitelist-updates\" id=\"whitelist-updates\">\n            <h2>Product Updates</h2>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">Copilot for Eclipse Open Source</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    GitHub Copilot for Eclipse is now open source, making codebase available for community contribution and transparency.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                    <span>GitHub Copilot</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-21</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">Semantic Issue Search in Copilot Chat</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    Semantic issue search functionality in Copilot Chat enables more intelligent code issue discovery and resolution.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <span>GitHub Copilot</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-20</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">Auto Model Selection Based on Task</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    Copilot now automatically routes to appropriate models based on specific task being performed in VS Code, improving efficiency and accuracy.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <span>GitHub Copilot</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-20</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini 3.5 Flash Generally Available</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    Google's Gemini 3.5 Flash model now generally available for GitHub Copilot users, providing faster AI assistance.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                    <span>GitHub Copilot</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-19</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://windsurf.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Bug Fixes and Improvements (v2.3.9)</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    Fixed swe-check model availability, improved terminal performance, restored conversation sharing, repaired path resolution for Devin agent on WSL.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type bugfix\">Bug Fix</span>\n                    <span>Windsurf</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-17</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">GPT-5.3-Codex Base Model</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    GPT-5.3-Codex now base model for Copilot Business and Enterprise tiers, offering improved coding capabilities.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                    <span>GitHub Copilot</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-17</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new\" target=\"_blank\">Agent View Feature (v2.1.139–v2.1.142)</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    Introduced Agent view with <code>claude agents</code> command showing one screen per session with running/blocked/done tasks.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <span>Claude Code</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-15</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/overview\" target=\"_blank\">Platform Default Settings and Slack</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    Added platform default settings (Linux/Windows), Slack channel override, MCP OAuth resource parameter support.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <span>Devin</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-15</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://cursor.sh/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Background Agents in Slack</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    Launch Background Agents from Slack by mentioning @Cursor. Agents read threads, understand context, create PRs without leaving Slack.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <span>Cursor</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-15</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">Team-level Usage Metrics API</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    Team-level Copilot usage metrics now available via API, giving organizations better visibility into AI adoption and spending.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <span>GitHub Copilot</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-14</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot App Technical Preview</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    New Copilot app released in technical preview, expanding Copilot's accessibility and integration options.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                    <span>GitHub Copilot</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-14</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://windsurf.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Opus 4.7 (fast mode)</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    Claude Opus 4.7 (fast mode) now available with full intelligence of Opus 4.7 but ~2.5x higher output speeds.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <span>Windsurf</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-12</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://developers.googleblog.com/an-important-update-transitioning-gemini-cli-to-antigravity-cli/\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini CLI Deprecation Notice</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    Gemini CLI and Code Assist IDE extensions will stop serving on June 18, 2026, transitioning users to Antigravity CLI.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type announcement\">Announcement</span>\n                    <span>Gemini CLI</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-10</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/overview\" target=\"_blank\">GitLab Interactive PR Review</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    GitLab repositories now support interactive PR review with ability to post comments and resolve threads with read-write connection.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <span>Devin</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-10</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://cursor.sh/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">BugBot Automatic Code Review</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    Cursor 1.0 introduced BugBot for automatic code review catching bugs in PRs, leaving comments with 'Fix in Cursor' integration.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <span>Cursor</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-10</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new\" target=\"_blank\">Goal Command and Fast Mode (v2.1.128–v2.1.136)</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    Introduced <code>/goal</code> command keeping Claude working across turns until completion. Fast mode runs on Opus 4.7 by default. Rewind menu compresses context.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <span>Claude Code</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-08</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://releasebot.io/updates/google/gemini-cli\" target=\"_blank\">May 2026 Update</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    Command line improvements, core and UI improvements, new session deletion options, commands listing, voice mode upgrades.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <span>Gemini CLI</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-08</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://cursor.sh/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Background Agent General Availability</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    Cursor's remote coding agent now available to all users, enabling parallel task execution with cloud icon or Cmd/Ctrl+E.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                    <span>Cursor</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-08</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://windsurf.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Devin Review & Quick Review</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    All Windsurf IDE users now have access to Devin Review and Quick Review. Devin Review available for self-serve users with 2 week free trial.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <span>Windsurf</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-06</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"update-card\">\n                <div class=\"update-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://cursor.sh/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Memories Feature Beta</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-description\">\n                    Memories beta allows AI to remember facts from conversations and reference them in future sessions, stored per project at individual level.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"update-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <span>Cursor</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-05</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Technical Insights Section -->\n        <section class=\"technical-insights\" id=\"technical-insights\">\n            <h2>Technical Insights</h2>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-card\">\n                <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.windowscentral.com/microsoft/microsoft-cancels-claude-code-licenses-shifting-developers-to-github-copilot-cli-a-move-likely-driven-by-financial-motives\" target=\"_blank\">Microsoft Cancels Claude Code Licenses</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-description\">\n                    Microsoft canceling Claude Code licenses for thousands of developers. Deadline June 30, 2026. Shifting to GitHub Copilot CLI due to spiraling AI costs.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                    <span>Windows Central</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-24</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-card\">\n                <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://kanbots.dev\" target=\"_blank\">Kanbots: Open Source Kanban AI Agents</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-description\">\n                    v1.0 launched as MIT-licensed kanban running parallel Claude/Codex agents on every card. Autopilot mode, local-first, GitHub integration, MCP server.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                 