nnounced firms will pay $1M to settle charges about deceiving customers on 'Active Listening' AI. Actually just resold email lists at markup.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>\n                    <span>Simon Willison</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-22</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-card\">\n                <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Datasette Agent: First Release</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-description\">\n                    Extensible AI assistant integrating LLM with Datasette. Runs commands in Fly Sprites sandbox, 'View SQL query' buttons, permission-based tools.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                    <span>Simon Willison</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-21</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-card\">\n                <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">SpaceX-Anthropic: $1.25B/Month Compute Deal</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-description\">\n                    Anthropic paying $1.25 billion per month through May 2029 for SpaceX compute capacity. Capacity ramping in May-June 2026 at reduced fees.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                    <span>Simon Willison</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-20</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-card\">\n                <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">How Fast is 10 Tokens Per Second?</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-description\">\n                    Interactive HTML app simulating LLM token output speeds from 5/second to 800/second, helping users understand what different speeds feel like.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>\n                    <span>Simon Willison</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-20</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-card\">\n                <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini 3.5 Flash: Prompt Injection Concerns</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-description\">\n                    Google released Gemini 3.5 Flash and Gemini Spark agent. Simon concerned about prompt injection risks. Agent Gateway enforcing DLP policies in isolated VMs.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>\n                    <span>Simon Willison</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-20</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-card\">\n                <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini 3.5 Flash: More Expensive Strategy</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-description\">\n                    Gemini 3.5 Flash went straight to GA without preview. Google using it across many key products. Discusses pricing implications and strategy.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n              