deep testing of AI coding tools. Gap between hype and practical value.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type discussion\">Discussion</span>\n                    <span>Hacker News</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-18</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-card\">\n                <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=45727664\" target=\"_blank\">AI can code, but can't build software</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-description\">\n                    'LLMs are remarkably good at writing code. Writing code isn't the same thing as delivering working software.' Gap between code generation and software delivery.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type discussion\">Discussion</span>\n                    <span>Hacker News</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-19</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-card\">\n                <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=44079303\" target=\"_blank\">Ask HN: Go deep into AI/LLMs or just use as tools?</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-description\">\n                    Discussion on whether developers should specialize in AI/LLMs or use as productivity tools. Career strategy in age of AI assistants.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type discussion\">Discussion</span>\n                    <span>Hacker News</span>\n                    <span>• 2026-05-18</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-card\">\n                <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                