          "+                    UK GDS published 'Keep open by default' guidance in response to NHS closing repos after vulnerability reports. Major escalation in civil service disagreement.",
          "+                </div>",
          "+                <div class=\"insight-meta\">",
          "+                    <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>",
          "+                    <span>Simon Willison</span>",
          "+                    <span>• 2026-05-17</span>",
          "+                </div>",
          "+            </div>",
          "+",
          "+            <div class=\"insight-card\">",
          "+                <div class=\"insight-title\">",
          "+                    <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=44095189\" target=\"_blank\">Ask HN: Struggling to get value from coding LLMs?</a>",
          "+                </div>",
          "+                <div class=\"insight-description\">",
          "+                    Discussion exploring developer frustration after deep testing of AI coding tools. Gap between hype and practical value.",
          "+                </div>",
          "+                <div class=\"insight-meta\">",
          "+                    <span class=\"insight-type discussion\">Discussion</span>",
          "+                    <span>Hacker News</span>",
          "+                    <span>• 2026-05-18</span>",
          "+                </div>",
          "+            </div>",
          "+",
          "+            <div class=\"insight-card\">",
          "+                <div class=\"insight-title\">",
          "+                    <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=45727664\" target=\"_blank\">AI can code, but can't build software</a>",
          "+                </div>",
          "+                <div class=\"insight-description\">",
          "+                    'LLMs are remarkably good at writing code. Writing code isn't the same thing as delivering working software.' Gap between code generation and software delivery.",
          "+                </div>",
          "+                <div class=\"insight-meta\">",
          "+                    <span class=\"insight-type discussion\">Discussion</span>",
          "+                    <span>Hacker News</span>",
          "+                    <span>• 2026-05-19</span>",
          "+                </div>",
          "+            </div>",
          "+",
          "+            <div class=\"insight-card\">",
          "+                <div class=\"insight-title\">",
          "+                    <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=44079303\" target=\"_blank\">Ask HN: Go deep into AI/LLMs or just use as tools?</a>",
          "+                </div>",
          "+                <div class=\"insight-description\">",
          "+                    Discussion on whether developers should specialize in AI/LLMs or use as productivity tools. Career strategy in age of AI assistants.",
          "+                </div>",
          "+                <div class=\"insight-meta\">",
          "+                    <span class=\"insight-type discussion\">Discussion</span>",
          "+                    <span>Hacker News</span>",
          "+                    <span>• 2026-05-18</span>",
          "+                </div>",
          "+            </div>",
          "+",
          "+            <div class=\"insight-card\">",
          "+                <div class=\"insight-title\">",
          "+                    <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">ArXiv cs.AI and cs.LG Papers</a>",
          "+                </div>",
          "+                <div class=\"insight-description\">",
          "+                    Over 1,500 ML/AI papers submitted. Notable: 'GraphFlow' (ICML 2026), 'Vector Policy Optimization', 'Post-Training is About States', diffusion models, neural operators.",
          "+                </div>",
          "+                <div class=\"insight-meta\">",
          "+                    <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>",
          "+                    <span>ArXiv</span>",
          "+                    <span>• 2026-05-22</span>",
          "+                </div>",
          "+            </div>",
          "+        </section>",
          "+    </main>",
          "+",
          "+    <footer>",
          "+        <div class=\"container\">",
          "+            <p>Generated by <a href=\"#\">Agent Code Daily</a> - Powered by <a href=\"#\">Claude Agent SDK</a></p>",
          "+            <p style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">",
          "+                <a href=\"#\">About</a>",
          "+                <a href=\"#\">Archive</a>",
          "+                <a href=\"#\">RSS Feed</a>",
          "+                <a href=\"#\">Contact</a>",
          "             </p>",
          "-            <p style=\"margin-top: 5px; font-size: 8pt;\">",
          "-                Covering the agentic coding revolution | Updated daily",
